<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article (Aiming for SCP-5127)</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Anomalous airplane</li>
<li>Appears at airports that are either closed, either for the night or due to bad weather</li>
<li>It's destination is always one in high demand at the current aiport</li>
<li>Up to 26 passengers can 'transfer' to this flight</li>
<li>Plane does not show up on radar, and does not recieve instruction from air traffic control</li>
<li>Flight always lasts 2 hours, 47 minutes from take off to landing</li>
<li>Will land in some forsaken place, such as in the middle of Siberia, the Sahara, or even in the ocean</li>
<li>Aiport it lands at is also anomalous, appearing from the inside to be an exact copy of whatever aiport the plane was supposed to land at</li>
<li>Airport will spontaneously generate about 30 minutes before the plane lands</li>
<li>Aiport will remain in existince for exactly 75 minutes, before both it and the airplane disappear</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Honestly I don't really understand what this part is supposed to mean, so for the the time being, I will say None. But please feel free to give me advice on what to put here, as well as how to expand and improve this SCP.</p>

