<p>S.C.P GREENLIGHT REQUEST | Magmaite</p>
<p>Out of the two S.C.P.’s I plan to write, this proposal will be requesting the greenlight idea-approval of Magmaite. Magmaite, originally, is a large hand-sized rock with a gloss above a magma-like color scheme with fractures filled with a dried, black molten rock. “Ignition” is Magmaites “ability”; lava is able to be generated from the rock itself and within anything the lava consumed entirely will boost Magmaites physique and growth.</p>
<p>Before research begun, Magmaite was theorized to be not-sentient due to the nature of how it acted, though, afterwards it was confirmed to be the opposite; Magmaite was discovered as a sentient being along with the discovery of her screams. ( They are high-pitched, though are only bothering. Not lethal or painful&#8230; )</p>
<p>It’s maximum physique size seemingly does not have a limit, though recorded- it can only maintain a physique increase-inducement for ten-hours; afterwards, it will release mass-amounts of carbon dioxide and help induce global warming.</p>
<p>Magmaites general build, unlike its mass amount of consumption to help it grow bigger and bigger, maintains a sluggish-like body with, depending on its consumption and body size, several arms that can be manipulated.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;&quot;Lore&quot;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;&quot;Present&nbsp;Day&quot;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Out-of-Character / Information that could possibly never be found in the S.C.P. universe.</p>
<p>A married couple, Airisu- the wife, and Leo- the husband, on June 3rd had been reported missing while departing from the main route of the tour guide on a volcanic island. Airisu unknowingly had obtained a S.C.P.; her necklace had a rock that could absorb intense heat and infuse it with sentient life, though surprisingly this never occurred. They went so far out they found a native tribe, with the language barrier- almost instantly attacked the husband first while the volcano simultaneously fired. Her emotions rushed inwards with sob and anger, cracking through the pores of her skin. Tears rushing down while her furious facial expressions tightened, both arms wrapped around Leo, and her back was shot.</p>
<p>A landslid of erupted ash and lava came hurdling downwards; dried-up volcanic material and lava from the mantle. The necklace instantly ignited it’s “only” purpose; heat infusing inducement. Airise’s sentientness was now trapped inside Magmaite, with Leo trapped in Volcanoite. Her anger and rage from that day still rushes her system with heat, and her tears and sadness for death bursts her movement. With Leo- a.k.a.: Volcanoite, she is pleased with glee- happiness. Though, it puts the rest of the world at stake&#8230;</p>
<p>Must she give her happiness and stay full of anger and sadness alone, or be with Volcanoite and allow the world to suffer&#8230;.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

